    {
      "quote": "licensed firms that intend to submit STRs via the XML format are required to follow the XML schema provided separately by the JFIU and liaise with it as soon as possible to arrange a technical test to ensure a smooth transition.",
      "unit_id": "da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"
    },
    {
      "quote": "for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;",
      "unit_id": "da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"
